  "content": "<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wishful-recipes\"><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/91/a0/caG03Acz_o.png\" alt=\"此模組已成為「Wishful Recipes」的一部分。請點擊此處查看。它能自動生成合成表，因此與其他模組高度相容且無需過多配置。\"/></a>\n<h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kJdiggR.png\" alt=\"標題\"/></h1>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-clay-and-clay-balls\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/956343?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blasting-clay-and-clay-balls\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/blasting-clay-and-clay-balls?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">這款可完全配置的模組讓您在高爐中熔煉黏土、黏土塊和陶土的速度是普通熔爐的兩倍。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/haJFk6e.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/i7ZQEF8.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rmPI78y.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\" /></p></center>\n<details>\n<summary><strong>配置</strong></summary>\n<p>您可以直接在遊戲內配置此模組，或編輯設定檔資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/blastingclay.json</code>。請注意，任何變更都需要重新啟動 Minecraft 才會生效。</p>\n<center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>blasting_list</b> - 一個字符串列表，每個字符串代表一個高爐配方，指定輸入物品、輸出物品以及高爐熔煉所得經驗值</p>\n</center>\n</details>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"/>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"/></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"/></a>\n</p></center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
